counterfactuals.output:
A method comprising:

inserting, into a mobile communication device, a removable secure digital (SD) card comprising radio-frequency communication circuitry, an antenna, and a memory storing executable instructions and/or configuration data;

receiving, by the mobile communication device from the removable SD card, an identifier associated with the removable SD card;

transmitting, by the mobile communication device, the identifier to a remote server over a communication network;

receiving, by the mobile communication device from the remote server, hearing-aid configuration information authorized for use with the removable SD card based at least in part on the identifier; and

configuring, by the mobile communication device using the received hearing-aid configuration information, a wireless communication link between the radio-frequency communication circuitry of the removable SD card and a hearing aid.
